      "prompt": "In D2, list every member once: =UNIQUE(A2:A13). Type it only in D2, and watch it spill down.",
      "teach": "**UNIQUE(range)** gives back each different value once, in the order they first appear. You type it in **one** cell, and the answers **spill** into the cells below. The spilled cells are greyed in the formula bar: only D2 holds the formula. If something is blocking the spill, you get a **#SPILL!** error, so keep the cells below empty.",
